Raspberry Pi 5 Network Driver Porting Roadmap
==============================================

This document outlines the phased implementation plan for porting
the Raspberry Pi 5 network drivers from Linux to FreeBSD.

Hardware Overview
-----------------
The Raspberry Pi 5 uses a different architecture than RPi4:

- BCM2712 SoC (Cortex-A76 quad-core)
- RP1 I/O controller (connected via PCIe)
  - Vendor ID: 0x1de4 (Raspberry Pi)
  - Device ID: 0x0001 (RP1 C0)
- Ethernet: GENET MAC (same IP as RPi4, but accessed via RP1)
- PHY: BCM54213PE (same as RPi4)
- WiFi: CYW43455 (via SDIO on RP1)

