Build Instructions
------------------
To build as a kernel module:

    cd /usr/src/sys/modules/rp1
    make

To include in kernel:

    Add to kernel config:
        device rp1

Testing Notes
-------------
Testing requires Raspberry Pi 5 hardware. The driver can be
loaded with:

    kldload rp1

Check dmesg for:
    rp1: RP1 chip_id=0x... platform=0x...
    rp1eth: GENET revision 0x...

